    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just grief though. when i was competing, i knew exactly who i was. there was a direction to everything. now there's no direction. i look at myself and i don't even see a person, just a reminder of what i lost. it feels like the \"me\" that actually mattered is already dead, and i'm just sitting here waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
